FELDCORE installer.

This image does not install itself onto the disk it booted from.
To write the appliance onto another whole disk:

  feldcore-install --yes /dev/disk

The command refuses the booted disk and any disk with a mounted partition.
A feldcore-install.json file on another FAT or exFAT volume (the Ventoy
partition, or a second stick) is copied onto the new system. No answer
file leaves setup to the browser wizard after the appliance boots.
